  "articleBody": "Before hiring a backyard cottage contractor, confirm the property’s jurisdiction, measure the available buildable area, define how the unit will be used, and compare proposals by scope rather than headline price. Gather a current site plan, utility information, title or ownership details, and any known easements or fire-access concerns so the design and permit review start with accurate information.",
